{"id":"ae8a178ef886b6dc","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/585_公共宣告逻辑_PAL.md","title":"585 公共宣告逻辑 PAL","display":"585_公共宣告逻辑_PAL","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ag}_{585}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ag}_{585}\\)</span> 为非空有限主体集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{585}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}_{585}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。对任意集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},K_a,\\operatorname{ann}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},K_a,\\operatorname{ann}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ann}(A,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{ann}(A,B)\\)</span> 显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[!A]B\">\\([!A]B\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>派生记号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B)\">\\(A\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A)\">\\(A\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{585}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{585}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{585}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{585}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_aA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\">\\(K_aA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[!A]B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\">\\([!A]B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与替换\">3. 自由变元与替换</h1>\n<p>自由命题变元函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{585}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{585}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{585}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{585}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{585}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{585}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{585}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{585}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{585}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{585}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{585}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{585}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{585}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{585}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{585}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{585}(K_aA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{585}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{585}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{585}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{585}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{585}(K_aA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{585}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{585}([!A]B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{585}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{585}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{585}([!A]B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{585}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{585}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{585}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{585}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{585}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{585}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,585}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,585}\\)</span> 为构造树相等。有限支撑命题替换集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{585}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{585}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{585})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{585}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{585}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{585})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{585}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{585}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{585}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{585}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{585}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{585}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{585}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{585}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{585}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{585}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{585}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{585}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{585}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{585}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{585}(B,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{585}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{585}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{585}(B,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{585}(K_aA,\\sigma)=K_a\\operatorname{Sub}_{585}(A,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{585}([!A]B,\\sigma)\n=\n[!\\operatorname{Sub}_{585}(A,\\sigma)]\\operatorname{Sub}_{585}(B,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{585}(K_aA,\\sigma)=K_a\\operatorname{Sub}_{585}(A,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{585}([!A]B,\\sigma)\n=\n[!\\operatorname{Sub}_{585}(A,\\sigma)]\\operatorname{Sub}_{585}(B,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-静态知识公理\">4. 静态知识公理</h1>\n<p>下列三个命题公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{585}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{585}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{585}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{585}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{585}\n=\n\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{585}\n=\n\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{585}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{585}\\)</span>，定义静态知识公理集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{585}\n=\n\\{K_a(A\\to B)\\to(K_aA\\to K_aB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{585}\n=\n\\{K_a(A\\to B)\\to(K_aA\\to K_aB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{T,a}^{585}\n=\n\\{K_aA\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{T,a}^{585}\n=\n\\{K_aA\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{4,a}^{585}\n=\n\\{K_aA\\to K_aK_aA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{4,a}^{585}\n=\n\\{K_aA\\to K_aK_aA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{5,a}^{585}\n=\n\\{\\neg K_aA\\to K_a\\neg K_aA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{5,a}^{585}\n=\n\\{\\neg K_aA\\to K_a\\neg K_aA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-宣告归约公理\">5. 宣告归约公理</h1>\n<p>公共宣告归约族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnAt}^{585}\n=\n\\{[!A]p\\leftrightarrow(A\\to p):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585},p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{585}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnAt}^{585}\n=\n\\{[!A]p\\leftrightarrow(A\\to p):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585},p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{585}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnBot}^{585}\n=\n\\{[!A]\\bot\\leftrightarrow(A\\to\\bot):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnBot}^{585}\n=\n\\{[!A]\\bot\\leftrightarrow(A\\to\\bot):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnNeg}^{585}\n=\n\\{[!A]\\neg B\\leftrightarrow(A\\to\\neg[!A]B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnNeg}^{585}\n=\n\\{[!A]\\neg B\\leftrightarrow(A\\to\\neg[!A]B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnImp}^{585}\n=\n\\{[!A](B\\to C)\\leftrightarrow([!A]B\\to[!A]C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnImp}^{585}\n=\n\\{[!A](B\\to C)\\leftrightarrow([!A]B\\to[!A]C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnK}^{585}\n=\n\\{[!A]K_aB\\leftrightarrow(A\\to K_a[!A]B):a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{585},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnK}^{585}\n=\n\\{[!A]K_aB\\leftrightarrow(A\\to K_a[!A]B):a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{585},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{585}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{585}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{585}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{585}\n\\cup\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{585}}\n(\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{585}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T,a}^{585}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4,a}^{585}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{5,a}^{585})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{585}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{585}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{585}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{585}\n\\cup\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{585}}\n(\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{585}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T,a}^{585}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4,a}^{585}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{5,a}^{585})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\qquad\\qquad\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnAt}^{585}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnBot}^{585}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnNeg}^{585}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnImp}^{585}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnK}^{585}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\qquad\\qquad\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnAt}^{585}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnBot}^{585}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnNeg}^{585}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnImp}^{585}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnK}^{585}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公共宣告归约公理总集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Red}_{585}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnAt}^{585}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnBot}^{585}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnNeg}^{585}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnImp}^{585}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnK}^{585}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Red}_{585}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnAt}^{585}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnBot}^{585}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnNeg}^{585}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnImp}^{585}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{AnnK}^{585}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{585}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{585}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{585}=\\{((A),K_aA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{585}=\\{((A),K_aA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个主体定义，并且只作用于空依赖行。宣告构造子没有独立必然化规则。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{585}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{585}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{585}\\)</span>，并且每行满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{585}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{585}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{585}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{585}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{585}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{585}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{585}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{585}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{585}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{585}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\text{使 }\\pi\\text{ 的末行为 }(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{585}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{585}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\text{使 }\\pi\\text{ 的末行为 }(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目的目标特征是二元动态构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[!A]B\">\\([!A]B\\)</span> 与五类归约公理。它不是普通认识逻辑，因为宣告公式本身是对象语言公式。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-公告更新语义载体与后承\">10. 公告更新语义载体与后承</h1>\n<p>等价关系谓词定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EqRel}_{585}(W,R)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq W\\times W\n\\wedge\n\\forall w\\in W\\ (w,w)\\in R\n\\wedge\n\\forall u,v\\in W\\ ((u,v)\\in R\\Rightarrow(v,u)\\in R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EqRel}_{585}(W,R)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq W\\times W\n\\wedge\n\\forall w\\in W\\ (w,w)\\in R\n\\wedge\n\\forall u,v\\in W\\ ((u,v)\\in R\\Rightarrow(v,u)\\in R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\wedge\n\\forall u,v,z\\in W\\ ((u,v)\\in R\\wedge(v,z)\\in R\\Rightarrow(u,z)\\in R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\wedge\n\\forall u,v,z\\in W\\ ((u,v)\\in R\\wedge(v,z)\\in R\\Rightarrow(u,z)\\in R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>PAL 模型集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PALMod}_{585}\n=\n\\{(W,(R_a)_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{585}},V):W\\ne\\varnothing,\\ \\forall a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{585}\\ \\operatorname{EqRel}_{585}(W,R_a),\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{585}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{PALMod}_{585}\n=\n\\{(W,(R_a)_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{585}},V):W\\ne\\varnothing,\\ \\forall a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{585}\\ \\operatorname{EqRel}_{585}(W,R_a),\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{585}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,(R_a)_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{585}},V)\\in\\mathsf{PALMod}_{585}\">\\(M=(W,(R_a)_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{585}},V)\\in\\mathsf{PALMod}_{585}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_M^{585}=\\{w\\in W:M,w\\models_{585}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_M^{585}=\\{w\\in W:M,w\\models_{585}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公告限制模型定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M|A=(W_A,(R_a^A)_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{585}},V_A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M|A=(W_A,(R_a^A)_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{585}},V_A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W_A=\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_M^{585},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W_A=\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_M^{585},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_a^A=R_a\\cap(W_A\\times W_A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_a^A=R_a\\cap(W_A\\times W_A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V_A(p)=V(p)\\cap W_A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V_A(p)=V(p)\\cap W_A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，满足关系递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{585}p\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,w\\not\\models_{585}\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{585}p\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,w\\not\\models_{585}\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{585}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(M,w\\models_{585}A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{585}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(M,w\\models_{585}A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{585}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{585}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,w\\models_{585}B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{585}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{585}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,w\\models_{585}B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{585}K_aA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\ ((w,v)\\in R_a\\Rightarrow M,v\\models_{585}A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{585}K_aA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\ ((w,v)\\in R_a\\Rightarrow M,v\\models_{585}A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{585}[!A]B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigl(M,w\\models_{585}A\\Rightarrow M|A,w\\models_{585}B\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{585}[!A]B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigl(M,w\\models_{585}A\\Rightarrow M|A,w\\models_{585}B\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{585}^{\\mathsf{pal}}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{585}^{\\mathsf{pal}}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,(R_a)_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{585}},V)\\in\\mathsf{PALMod}_{585}\">\\(M=(W,(R_a)_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{585}},V)\\in\\mathsf{PALMod}_{585}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,w\\models_{585}B)\">\\(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,w\\models_{585}B)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{585}A\">\\(M,w\\models_{585}A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{PAL}_{585}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Ag}_{585},\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{585},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{585},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{585},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{585},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,585},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{585},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{585},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{585},\n\\mathsf{Red}_{585},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{585},\n(\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{585})_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{585}},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{585},\n\\vdash_{585},\n\\operatorname{EqRel}_{585},\n\\mathsf{PALMod}_{585},\n\\llbracket-\\rrbracket^{585},\n(-)|(-),\n\\models_{585},\n\\models_{585}^{\\mathsf{pal}}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{PAL}_{585}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Ag}_{585},\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{585},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{585},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{585},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{585},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,585},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{585},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{585},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{585},\n\\mathsf{Red}_{585},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{585},\n(\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{585})_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{585}},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{585},\n\\vdash_{585},\n\\operatorname{EqRel}_{585},\n\\mathsf{PALMod}_{585},\n\\llbracket-\\rrbracket^{585},\n(-)|(-),\n\\models_{585},\n\\models_{585}^{\\mathsf{pal}}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含公共宣告句法、公理、规则、证明对象、可证性、公告模型更新语义和语义后承；不含事件模型推广机制或完备性定理。<